# Directory patterns are anchored with a leading slash on purpose. An unanchored
# `foo/` matches at EVERY depth, so it also swallows `rwf-lib/src/foo/` — a new
# source module would vanish from `git status` and never get committed, silently.
# Guarded by rwf-bin/tests/repo_contracts.rs; see docs/IMPLICIT_CONTRACTS.md.
/target/
/debug/
qwen-code-export-*
/logs/
/sample/
/.superpowers/
/docs/superpowers/
*.bak
/.worktrees/
